        <mxCell id="key" value="HOW TO READ: left column = inspect's steps, dashed grey because none of them ever runs here; the line numbers are inspect_ai tag 0.3.263. Right column = the ScreamingFace component, coloured by WHEN: blue = image build, once · gold = the model seat, run time · green = run time, per Case or per Candidate · purple cylinder = where data rests. ① to ⑦ number the rows of the table under this diagram that have a box: the model-roles row is part of ③, epochs is part of ④, and the sandbox row has no box because it is refused at import. Tags inside a box: ⏱ when · 🌐 network · 🔐 trust · 🧩 meaning · 🔀 ordering · 💰 paid." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#9fb0c3;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
